#. type: Attribute 'xreflabel' of: <chapter>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/mail.xml:8
#, xml-text
msgid "MTA"
msgstr "MTA"

#. type: Content of: <chapter><title>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/mail.xml:11
#, xml-text
msgid "Mail Server Software"
msgstr "Logiciário de Servidor de Mensagens"

#. type: Content of: <chapter><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/mail.xml:14
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"MTAs are the programs which transport mail from one machine to the other. "
"The traditional MTA is <application>Sendmail</application>, however there "
"are several other choices. BLFS does not include the "
"<application>Sendmail</application> package anymore, but both "
"<application>Exim</application> and <application>Postfix</application> "
"provide the same functionality as well as a compatibility symlink for "
"applications that expect <application>Sendmail</application> to be present."
msgstr ""
"MTAs são os programas que transportam mensagens de uma máquina para outra. O"
" MTA tradicional é o <application>Sendmail</application>, porém existem "
"diversas outras escolhas. O BLFS não mais inclui o pacote "
"<application>Sendmail</application>, mas ambos, "
"<application>Exim</application> e <application>Postfix</application>, "
"fornecem a mesma funcionalidade, bem como um linque simbólico de "
"compatibilidade para aplicativos que esperam que o "
"<application>Sendmail</application> esteja presente."

#. type: Content of: <chapter><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/mail.xml:24
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In addition to the SMTP servers, there is also a POP3/IMAP server (Dovecot)."
msgstr ""
"Em adição aos servidores SMTP, também existe um servidor POP3/IMAP "
"(Dovecot)."

